    {
      "assumption": "ROCE recovers from the depressed FY2021 level of ~6% toward 9-10% as incremental capital deployed in telecom and retail earns progressively higher returns, validating the net income ramp from INR 37,500 Cr to INR 47,500 Cr by FY2024.",
